Package: sixter
Version: 2.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sixter <sahith@sixter.in>
Recommends: nginx, certbot, python3-certbot-nginx, nftables
Description: Sixter - secure tunnel network, deployment & firewall
 Sixter exposes localhost to the world, deploys projects to your server,
 binds custom domains with automatic HTTPS, gives every project a web/SSH
 terminal, and inspects all traffic with an application firewall.
 .
 Commands: sixter login | tunnel | repo | repo-server
